# The bottom bar's places: 文件 tapped (its page in place of the chats', the ball going to it); the bar drawn up into
# the panel of the other bar and let go on 奏 there (that bar in view, 奏's page); 用量 tapped; the panel again, the
# chats picked in it (the first bar back in view).
timeout 60000
until 端到端测试
tap icon:folder
until =文件
gone 端到端测试
shot 1-files
tap icon:chats
until 端到端测试
dragon 0 -64 1000 icon:chats
until =奏
shot 2-decisions
tap icon:chart
until =用量
shot 3-usage
dragon 0 -64 1000 icon:zou
until 端到端测试
shot 4-chats
